---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Cheatsheet - Referensi Cepat Teknologi & IT | BeebaneLabs"
  description="Kumpulan cheatsheet dan referensi cepat untuk 12 topik teknologi: ESP32, Python, Git, Docker, SQL, dan lainnya."
  canonicalUrl="https://beebanelabs.pages.dev/cheatsheet.html"
>

  <section class="hero-section cheatsheet-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cheatsheet-icon">📋</div>
      <h1>Cheatsheet & Referensi Cepat</h1>
      <p class="cheatsheet-subtitle">Kumpulan cheatsheet ringkas untuk 12 topik teknologi. Gratis, siap pakai, bisa di-bookmark.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cheatsheet-grid-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="category-grid cheatsheet-grid">

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-esp32-iot.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>ESP32 & IoT</h3>
          <p>Pinout, command Arduino, wiring sensor, MQTT</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-python.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">💻</div>
          <h3>Python</h3>
          <p>Syntax, data structure, list comprehension, modules</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-linux-security.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">🔐</div>
          <h3>Linux Security</h3>
          <p>iptables, SSH hardening, fail2ban, nmap</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-grafana-nodered.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">📊</div>
          <h3>Grafana & Node-RED</h3>
          <p>PromQL, dashboard, flow automation, alerting</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-mqtt-http.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">📡</div>
          <h3>MQTT & HTTP</h3>
          <p>QoS, topics, status codes, REST API, WebSocket</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-html-css-js.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">🌐</div>
          <h3>HTML, CSS & JavaScript</h3>
          <p>Semantic HTML, Flexbox/Grid, ES6+, fetch API</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-sql.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">🗄️</div>
          <h3>SQL</h3>
          <p>JOIN, GROUP BY, window functions, CTE, index</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-python-datascience.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>Python Data Science</h3>
          <p>NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib, Scikit-learn</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-flutter-dart.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">📱</div>
          <h3>Flutter & Dart</h3>
          <p>Widget, state management, navigation, HTTP</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-docker-k8s.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">⚙️</div>
          <h3>Docker & Kubernetes</h3>
          <p>Dockerfile, compose, kubectl, YAML manifests</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-it-certification.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">💼</div>
          <h3>IT Certification</h3>
          <p>Roadmap, salary, exam tips, study guide</p>
        </a>

        <a href="articles/cheatsheet-networking-mikrotik.html" class="category-card cheatsheet-card">
          <div class="cheatsheet-card-icon">🌐</div>
          <h3>Networking & MikroTik</h3>
          <p>OSI, subnetting, RouterOS, firewall, VLAN</p>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
